      "text": "**cloudy-u-containers_cgc**  ◀ THIS REPO\ncode · 🌐 public · 1.1.3.1.2\nPublic half of the cgc code knowledge graph pipeline: octocode indexes of the public repos -> GHCR -> cloud-cg\n[GitHub](https://github.com/diegonmarcos/cloudy-u-containers_cgc)",
